Subject: [PATCH] sapphire-0232: pdp_ip0, the cellular data interface: raw IP
 over the IPA's modem endpoints (mux 1), a 64-packet TX queue drained by the
 modem thread into 64 DMA buffers, kern.sweet_pdp_stats

